      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "让我们在赛场上一起奔跑吧。\r\n现在，就是我为你送上这份厚礼的时候了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "adcf14168784c8a06c5a17df249cfd8067ace088863a39086668852408d4f627",
