      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "沐浴在观众们的欢呼声之中，\r\n今日诞生的新一届德比赛马娘——\r\n樱花千代王开心地挥舞着双手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcf259b72fd6ac9648bb62f2346cc3b496f22aceeb74e82c33ae4032ad11e823",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
