      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这便是我和她都曾在心中无数次想象、\r\n一直梦寐以求的场景——",
      "source_fingerprint": "41ccbd1ad33ceeffd2ee4b3291e11a302c82b9a0a603444187f1b848b061bd7b",
