      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26448733043b62e199ec0886",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "追逐丸善小姐的背影、\r\n实现丸善小姐托付的心愿、以及『想要获胜』。\r\n这些都是驱使我前进的“原点”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf8d1c6d6cbfa54e850a1411eeb6b8d0f192c8fa8d0a918f843d0dfb945f8099",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069308.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a13cd8287657abc4d0f2d547",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花千代王",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec59744d588a1310f2984a7c0c6f87f1b1077dca51cda1c301578865155b5c9d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
