    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be7cd28c16aa21997b8e650a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "根据检查的结果，因为她迄今为止无数次的强行\r\n训练与参赛，目白阿尔丹双脚的伤情已经相当严\r\n重了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cb98b94222775361748156713796a62f9f1936a8133b74ac6c39ac45b0635ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069308.json",
