    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95e907124741a7cb12847c0b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了治疗，她又会如先前那般不断住院……\r\n而能不能回归闪耀・系列赛也很难说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3c81572c87ca7f1bd4d250b68853887667e2f301d0eb461e9fc18a47405f44",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
