      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的潜意识其实一直在阻止我胡来。\r\n它告诉我，我的身体已经濒临崩溃，\r\n绝不能再继续前进了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1a5112f7dce104d1efdb89788ea6e7b3dadafb5da4f2e4b45a3cbdf0f4d9641",
